# Ordering in a Russian restaurant: принеси́те, пожа́луйста
subtitle: "Order a whole meal in Russian: я бу́ду суп, на пе́рвое, на второ́е, на десе́рт, принеси́те, пожа́луйста, and мо́жно счёт?"
tags: ["russian","russian restaurant","ordering food in russian","принесите","меню"]
teaches: ["phrases/restaurant","phrases/ordering"]
thumb: "band \"Three courses in Russian\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"Shopping in Russian: можно примерить?","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/75-russian-shopping.cast"}

## Ordering in a Russian restaurant: принеси́те, пожа́луйста
level: basic

    icon plate size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 540 or ["fork and knife"] icon_look picture of "fork and knife with plate" hidden true
    text k0 "Суп, пожа́луйста." say "Суп, пожа́луйста." x 500 y 380 font_size 64 hidden true
    icon tom size 120 set twemoji x 915 y 450 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man hidden true
    text tom_name "официа́нт" say официа́нт x 912 y 345 font_size 30 hidden true
    icon masha size 120 set twemoji x 85 y 450 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman hidden true
    text masha_name "Masha" #8f887c x 85 y 350 font_size 28 hidden true
    icon balloon_t size 90 set twemoji x 780 y 330 or ["right anger bubble"] icon_look picture of "speech balloon" hidden true
    icon balloon size 90 set twemoji x 220 y 330 or ["right anger bubble"] icon_look picture of "speech balloon" hidden true
    icon soup size 110 set twemoji x 230 y 560 or ["bowl with spoon","stew"] icon_look picture of "pot of food" hidden true
    text o1 "Я бу́ду суп." say "Я бу́ду суп." say_voice b x 560 y 560 font_size 62 hidden true
    text o2 "Что вы бу́дете?" say "Что вы бу́дете?" x 560 y 440 font_size 56 hidden true
    icon fish size 110 set twemoji x 230 y 310 or ["tropical fish"] icon_look picture of fish hidden true
    text o3a "Я бу́ду" say "Я бу́ду ры́бу." say_voice b x 490 y 310 font_size 62 hidden true
    text o3b "ры́бу." say ры́бу say_voice b colors {"у$":"#3f7d4e"} x 680 y 310 font_size 62 hidden true
    box menu_card "" x 500 y 400 width 580 height 520 radius 16 hidden true
    text menu_t "МЕНЮ́" say меню́ x 500 y 615 font_size 52 hidden true
    text m1h "на пе́рвое" #c9871a say "на пе́рвое" x 500 y 552 font_size 36 hidden true
    text m1 "суп с яйцо́м" say "суп с яйцо́м" say_voice b x 500 y 505 font_size 42 hidden true
    text m2h "на второ́е" #c9871a say "на второ́е" x 500 y 440 font_size 36 hidden true
    text m2 "ры́ба с карто́шкой" say "ры́ба с карто́шкой" say_voice b x 500 y 393 font_size 42 hidden true
    text m3 "мя́со с карто́шкой" say "мя́со с карто́шкой" say_voice b x 500 y 346 font_size 42 hidden true
    text m4h "на десе́рт" #c9871a say "на десе́рт" x 500 y 281 font_size 36 hidden true
    text m4 "торт" say торт say_voice b x 500 y 234 font_size 42 hidden true
    text m4g "cake" #8f887c x 500 y 192 font_size 30 hidden true
    group menu members ["menu_card","menu_t","m1h","m1","m2h","m2","m3","m4h","m4","m4g"] hidden true
    icon m_soup size 100 set twemoji x 130 y 505 or ["bowl with spoon"] icon_look picture of "pot of food" hidden true
    icon m_fish size 100 set twemoji x 130 y 370 or ["tropical fish"] icon_look picture of fish hidden true
    icon m_cake size 100 set twemoji x 130 y 225 or ["birthday cake"] icon_look picture of shortcake hidden true

A: Суп, пожа́луйста: that's how you ordered in lesson four. (@draw plate@) Today, a proper restaurant: a menu, three courses, and the bill.
    draw k0

    erase k0 plate

A: And today I'm the waiter, the официа́нт. Listen: (@draw masha masha_name@) I ask Masha what she'll have.
    draw tom tom_name

A: Что вы бу́дете на пе́рвое?
    draw balloon_t caption false

    erase balloon_t

    draw balloon

    ask "What will she have for the first course?" voice b options ["soup with egg","fish with potatoes","coffee with milk"] correct 1
        gloss: For the first course I'll have soup with egg.
        listen: На пе́рвое я бу́ду суп с яйцо́м.
        right: Soup with egg: суп с яйцо́м.
        wrong: Listen after бу́ду: суп с яйцо́м.

    erase balloon

    hide tom tom_name masha masha_name

A: Я бу́ду суп: I'll have soup. With a dish after it, бу́ду is how you order.
    draw soup o1

B: And the waiter asks: Что вы бу́дете? What will you have?
    draw o2

    draw fish

    quiz "Masha wants the fish. Я бу́ду … ?" store chk voice a pool false
        right: Ры́бу, as in да́йте ры́бу at the market.
        wrong: Think of да́йте ры́бу at the market.
        * ры́ба
        + ры́бу
        * ры́бой

A: Я бу́ду ры́бу, as in да́йте ры́бу at the market. Суп stays суп.
    draw o3a o3b

    highlight o3b color #3f7d4e part у$

    erase soup o1 o2 fish o3a o3b

B: Now the меню́. It never changes, like кино́.
    draw menu_card menu_t

A: A Russian lunch comes in courses. First, на пе́рвое: usually a soup.
    draw m1h m1 m_soup

A: Then на второ́е, the second course: the main dish.
    draw m2h m2 m3 m_fish

B: And to finish, на десе́рт: торт, a cake.
    draw m4h m4 m4g m_cake

A: You met карто́шка and яйцо́ in the kitchen last time. After с they take the with-ending: с (@highlight m1 color #2f6b8f part ом$@) карто́шкой, с яйцо́м.
    highlight m2 m3 color #2f6b8f part ой$

    hide menu m_soup m_fish m_cake

B: Я бу́ду is a plain order.
    icon w_fish size 120 set twemoji x 500 y 570 or ["tropical fish"] icon_look picture of fish
    text w0 "Я бу́ду ры́бу с карто́шкой." #8f887c x 500 y 430 font_size 44

B: Softer: я хоте́ла бы ры́бу с карто́шкой. I'd like…
    text w1 "Я хоте́ла бы ры́бу с карто́шкой." say "Я хоте́ла бы ры́бу с карто́шкой." say_voice b x 500 y 330 font_size 54

    highlight w1 color #c9871a part "хоте́ла бы" effect underline

    erase w_fish w0 w1

A: To have something brought, say принеси́те. Принеси́те, пожа́луйста, во́ду.
    icon water size 110 set twemoji x 500 y 580 or ["potable water"] icon_look picture of droplet
    text p1 "Принеси́те, пожа́луйста, во́ду." say "Принеси́те, пожа́луйста, во́ду." colors {"у$":"#3f7d4e"} x 500 y 440 font_size 58

    text p2 "прочита́йте · напиши́те" #8f887c x 500 y 340 font_size 40

B: It's a done verb with the вы ending те, like прочита́йте: one job, bring it once. And (@highlight p1 color #3f7d4e part у$@) во́да becomes во́ду.
    highlight p1 color #c9871a part Принеси́те effect underline

    erase water p1 p2

A: At the end, the bill: счёт. Извини́те! Мо́жно счёт?
    icon bill size 110 set twemoji x 500 y 580 or ["page facing up"] icon_look picture of receipt
    text b1 "Извини́те! Мо́жно счёт?" say "Извини́те! Мо́жно счёт?" say_voice b x 500 y 440 font_size 58

B: Мо́жно, as in мо́жно ко́фе? And принеси́те, пожа́луйста, счёт works too.
    text b2 "Мо́жно ко́фе?" #8f887c x 500 y 340 font_size 40
    text b3 "Принеси́те, пожа́луйста, счёт." say "Принеси́те, пожа́луйста, счёт." x 500 y 240 font_size 44

    erase bill b1 b2 b3

A: Now the whole lunch. Listen, then practise it.
    show masha masha_name tom tom_name

    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"a","text":"Здра́вствуйте! Меню́, пожа́луйста. Что вы бу́дете?","gloss":"Hello! Here's the menu. What will you have?"},{"by":"b","text":"На пе́рвое я бу́ду суп с яйцо́м.","gloss":"For the first course I'll have soup with egg."},{"by":"a","text":"А на второ́е?","gloss":"And for the main course?"},{"by":"b","text":"Я хоте́ла бы ры́бу с карто́шкой.","gloss":"I'd like fish with potatoes."},{"by":"a","text":"Хорошо́. А на десе́рт?","gloss":"Fine. And for dessert?"},{"by":"b","text":"Торт. И принеси́те, пожа́луйста, во́ду.","gloss":"Cake. And please bring some water."},{"by":"b","text":"Извини́те! Мо́жно счёт?","gloss":"Excuse me! Can I have the bill?"},{"by":"a","text":"Пожа́луйста. Пятьсо́т рубле́й.","gloss":"Here you are. Five hundred roubles."}] practice true size 1.5

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

A: Lunch is over. Masha calls me.

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

    icon q_water size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 500 or ["potable water"] icon_look picture of droplet

    quiz "Ask for water: Принеси́те, пожа́луйста, ___. Which word fills the gap?" reveal.text "Принеси́те во́ду." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Во́ду: what you ask for takes the у ending.
        wrong: Like ры́бу and кни́гу: во́да becomes во́ду.
        + во́ду
        * во́да
        * водо́й

    erase q_water

    icon q_woman size 160 set twemoji x 380 y 500 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman
    icon q_soup size 130 set twemoji x 620 y 500 or ["bowl with spoon"] icon_look picture of "pot of food"

    quiz "A woman orders soup politely. Which is right?" reveal.text "Я хоте́ла бы суп." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Хоте́ла бы: the past with a woman's а, and бы.
        wrong: Бы takes the past, and a woman says хоте́ла.
        * Я хоте́л бы суп.
        * Я хочу́ бы суп.
        + Я хоте́ла бы суп.

    erase q_woman q_soup

    icon q_bill size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 500 or ["page facing up"] icon_look picture of receipt

    quiz "Lunch is over and you want to pay. What do you say?" reveal.text "Мо́жно счёт?" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 300 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: Мо́жно счёт? The bill, please.
        wrong: The bill is счёт: мо́жно счёт?
        * Мо́жно меню́?
        + Мо́жно счёт?
        * На десе́рт счёт.

    erase q_bill

    icon q_waiter size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 560 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man

    ask "You're thirsty. Ask the waiter, politely, to bring water." gloss "Please bring some water." voice b show cue reveal.text "Принеси́те во́ду!" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 360 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1
        say_it: Принеси́те, пожа́луйста, во́ду.

    erase q_waiter

    icon q_meat size 140 set twemoji x 400 y 500 or ["meat on bone"] icon_look picture of "cut of meat"
    icon q_potato size 140 set twemoji x 620 y 500 or ["roasted sweet potato"] icon_look picture of potato

    ask "Now build a whole sentence. Type: For the main course I'll have meat with potatoes." answer ["на второе я буду мясо с картошкой","я буду мясо с картошкой на второе","на второе буду мясо с картошкой","я на второе буду мясо с картошкой"] voice a test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: На второ́е я бу́ду мя́со с карто́шкой: мя́со stays as it is, карто́шка takes ой after с.
        wrong: Start with на второ́е, then я бу́ду, then мя́со с карто́шкой.

B: На второ́е я бу́ду мя́со с карто́шкой.
    text q5_full "На второ́е я бу́ду мя́со с карто́шкой." say "На второ́е я бу́ду мя́со с карто́шкой." say_voice b colors {"ой$":"#2f6b8f"} x 500 y 330 font_size 50

    erase q_meat q_potato q5_full

    show menu m_soup m_fish m_cake

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So: я бу́ду and the dish to order, course by course, на пе́рвое, на второ́е, на десе́рт; принеси́те to have it brought; and мо́жно счёт? to pay.
    highlight m1h m2h m4h color #c9871a effect underline

    hide menu m_soup m_fish m_cake

B: Спаси́бо! До свида́ния!
    show masha masha_name tom tom_name

    hide masha masha_name tom tom_name

A: Next time: shopping for clothes.
    box next75 "Next: lesson 75 · shopping" x 500 y 430 width 620 height 130 radius 14 font_size 44

